            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI still can not reproduce this, unfortunately.\r\n\r\nAs said in #275, using [`vim.paste()` override](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/275#issuecomment-1476093091) is the best I can suggest right now. It should not give an actual error, but only show diagnostic warning which can be ignored (`:h vim.paste()` itself has an example of overriding it).\r\n\r\nTo make it have more chances at fixing, I'd like to ask you for more information:\r\n- Could you record a screencast of how it looks with **only** `require('mini.animate').setup()` as config, not whole overriding listed in the original issue comment.\r\n- Try proposed `vim.paste` override with plain `require('mini.animate').setup()` and look at what it does.",
